    "No direct brain/plasma or brain PK measurement for the exact query molecule.",
    "The closest analogues lack the terminal carboxylic acid, so the effect of this acidic group on passive permeability and efflux is not directly covered.",
    "No transporter or efflux data for the query's zwitterionic form."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
